Package: dawn
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @SHLIB_DEPS@, adduser, ca-certificates, curl, mosquitto, openssl, tzdata
Built-Using: @BUILT_USING@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/The-OASIS-Project/dawn
Description: voice assistant daemon (server, CPU build)
 The DAWN assistant's daemon: speech recognition (Whisper), speech synthesis
 (Piper), cloud or local language models, memory, tools, and the WebUI and
 DAP2 satellite server on port 3000.  Server build: no local microphone or
 speaker; you talk to it from the WebUI or a satellite.
 .
 Runs as the dawn system user (dawn.service), with its private libraries in
 /usr/lib/dawn, configuration in /etc/dawn and data in /var/lib/dawn.
 Speech-recognition and embedding models are downloaded on first start
 (dawn-models.service).  Needs an x86-64-v3 CPU (AVX2).
